ion\">\n                        <ul>\n<li>Statement I is false. We can't draw a straight line that passes through these three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-ad74d3109692b3025375211e97de5e92\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/ad74d3109692b3025375211e97de5e92\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Statement II is true. There is a straight line that passes through these three points.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-5e9466e0cfaf6c908f862c9d1139d3b1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/5e9466e0cfaf6c908f862c9d1139d3b1\"></div>\n\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"</p>\n\n                    </div>     \n                </div>                            \n                    \n            </div>",
